I heard a lot of "what items should I use" but little of strategy. The 
ascension run is just that. Have a method to locate the portal on each plane 
and go there directly with as little fighting as possible. ?oGD with a 
method to confuse yourself,
c?oGD or a crystal ball are the choices. Jumping boots and the spell speed 
or visa versa are a good combination to speed you along.

You should try to spend less than 500 turns on the planes.

Other than the items mentioned in other replies, here are a few suggestions.
Have the necessary items to avoid the threats that are more common to the 
Planes. Don't forget you can pray in the planes. A sure cure sickness in 
case Pestilence gets to you. A way to breathe underwater or /oTele in case 
an eel grabs you on the plane of Water (don't walk out of the bubble without 
levitation or "oMB). /oDeath for Famine and Pestilence. A few !oFH if you 
let the air elementals or the crowd on astral get you low. /oFire and/or 
/oLightning to put down a quick, permanent E word. Sleep spell/wand to block 
a doorway with a sleeping creature. You could wish for a [oOA if you get to 
the lawful altar first.

Read the messages. An adventurer with Vorpy has been known to appear on the 
Astral Plane.

You don't need a higher XL. The higher the XL the tougher the monsters. I've 
read of summoning storms fueled by archons ruining ascensions.

